   "body": "<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n<a href=\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/606?scope=ghh_OusAJGA4HG8ljoOV0wJvVx8NmnZIjc2DdjmxOu0xZWA&amp;cs_source=review_comment\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\" alt=\"Explain Change →\" height=\"32\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Walkthrough</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\nWhen the current document load fails, `FilteredPostsView` now clears `readyToken` before setting `failed`. Failures for stale document tokens remain ignored.\n\n**Changes: Filtered document failure handling**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|:---|:---|\n|**Update state on document failure** <br> `App/SwiftHFR/FilteredPosts/FilteredPostsView.swift`|For a matching document token, the failure callback clears `readyToken` before setting `failed`. Stale-token failures remain ignored.|\n\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n**Estimated code review effort:** 2 (Simple) | ~8 minutes\n\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"91585e430d482e70791930107a625e8c0bb46b8a\" -->\n<!-- change_assessment_priority:{\"version\":1,\"urgency\":\"p3\",\"manual\":false} -->\n**Change:** Bug fix · **Severity of issue fixed:** Low\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n\n**Possibly related issues**\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#566](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/issues/566) — This change makes a failed reload visible when the previously displayed document fails to load again.\n\n**Possibly related PRs**\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#575](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/575) — That PR adds the filtered-posts document failure callback and retry view used by this state update.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-unassessed-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Minimal</strong> · up to <code>91585</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **⚪ Minimal** · up to `91585`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"91585e430d482e70791930107a625e8c0bb46b8a\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"91585e430d482e70791930107a625e8c0bb46b8a\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nThe change is intended to restore the retry view after a failed reload. No merge-blocking risk is identified.\n<!-- final_review_risk_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Pre-merge checks: <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Passed\" title=\"Passed\"></picture></sup> 4 · <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-failed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Failed\" title=\"Failed\"></picture></sup> 1</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<strong><sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-failed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Failed\" title=\"Failed\"></picture></sup> Failed checks: 1 warning</strong>\n\n|     Check name     |                                              Status                                              | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                                               | Resolution                                                                         |\n| :---------------- | :----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------: | :-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Docstring Coverage | ![Warning](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-warning.svg) | Docstring coverage is 0.00% which is insufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%. Docstring coverage is scoped to functions touched by this diff with cyclomatic complexity of at least 2. Documentat… | Write docstrings for the functions missing them to satisfy the coverage threshold. |\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong><sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Passed\" title=\"Passed\"></picture></sup> Passed checks: 4 passed</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n|         Check name         |                                             Status                                             | Explanation                                                                            |\n| :------------------------ | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------: | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|      Description Check     | ![Passed](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-passed.svg) | Check skipped - CodeRabbit’s high-level summary is enabled.                            |\n|         Title check        | ![Passed](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-passed.svg) | The title accurately describes the retry option for a failed reload in filtered posts. |\n|     Linked Issues check    | ![Passed](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-passed.svg) | Check skipped because no linked issues were found for this pull request.               |\n| Out of Scope Changes check | ![Passed](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-passed.svg) | Check skipped because no linked issues were found for this pull request.               |\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Full details: Docstring Coverage</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n**Explanation**\n\nDocstring coverage is 0.00% which is insufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%. Docstring coverage is scoped to functions touched by this diff with cyclomatic complexity of at least 2. Documentation-only edits and deletions within surviving functions are included; unchanged diff context and fully deleted functions are excluded. Analyzed 1 functions across 1 files.\n\n**Resolution**\n\nWrite docstrings for the functions missing them to satisfy the coverage threshold.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Finishing Touches</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>Generate docstrings</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n- [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\":\"3e1879ae-f29b-4d0d-8e06-d12b7ba33d98\"} --> Commit to this branch\n- [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\":\"7962f53c-55bc-4827-bfbf-6a18da830691\"} --> Create a new PR\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>Generate unit tests (beta)</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n